
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>MyProject | Creative Portfolio</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
            scroll-padding-top: 80px;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #1f2937;
            background: #f8fafc;
        }

        /* Navigation */
        nav {
            background: #111827;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 8%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        nav h2 {
            font-size: 25px;
            color: #60a5fa;
        }

        nav ul {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            gap: 25px;
        }

        nav ul a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        nav ul a:hover {
            color: #60a5fa;
        }

        /* Hero */
        .hero {
            min-height: 75vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #111827, #1d4ed8);
            color: white;
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 800px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(36px, 6vw, 58px);
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            color: #93c5fd;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 19px;
            color: #e5e7eb;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 5px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: white;
            color: #1d4ed8;
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            border: 2px solid white;
            color: white;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        /* General Sections */
        section:not(.hero) {
            padding: 70px 8%;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 34px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: #111827;
        }

        .section-description {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 0 auto 40px;
            color: #6b7280;
        }

        /* Features */
        .cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(
                auto-fit,
                minmax(min(100%, 240px), 1fr)
            );
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px 25px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
        }

        .card .icon {
            font-size: 38px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: #2563eb;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .card p {
            color: #6b7280;
        }

        /* Projects */
        .projects {
            background: #eef2ff;
        }

        .project-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #e0e7ff;
        }

        .project-card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #1d4ed8;
        }

        .project-card p {
            color: #6b7280;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .project-link {
            color: #2563eb;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .project-link:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        /* About */
        .about-content {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: auto;
            text-align: center;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background: #111827;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px 15px;
        }

        footer p {
            color: #d1d5db;
        }

        footer a {
            color: #93c5fd;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        /* Mobile */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            nav {
                padding: 15px 5%;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 12px;
            }

            nav ul {
                justify-content: center;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
                gap: 15px;
            }

            .hero {
                min-height: 65vh;
            }

            .hero p {
                font-size: 16px;
            }

            section:not(.hero) {
                padding: 50px 6%;
            }

            .section-title {
                font-size: 28px;
            }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            html {
                scroll-behavior: auto;
            }

            *,
            *::before,
            *::after {
                transition: none !important;
                animation: none !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- Navigation -->
    <nav>
        <h2>MyProject.</h2>

        <ul>
            <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="#features">Features</a></li>
            <li><a href="#projects">Projects</a></li>
            <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <h1>Welcome to <span>MyProject</span></h1>

            <p>
                Building simple, creative, and responsive websites
                with modern web technologies.
            </p>

            <a
                href="#projects"
                class="btn btn-primary"
            >
                Explore Projects
            </a>

            <a
                href="https://github.com/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="btn btn-secondary"
            >
                Visit GitHub
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Features Section -->
    <section id="features">
        <h2 class="section-title">My Features</h2>

        <p class="section-description">
            Designed to deliver a clean, fast, and user-friendly
            browsing experience on every device.
        </p>

        <div class="cards">

            <div class="card">
                <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🚀</div>
                <h3>Fast Performance</h3>
                <p>
                    Lightweight HTML and CSS help the website
                    load quickly and run smoothly.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">📱</div>
                <h3>Responsive Design</h3>
                <p>
                    Flexible layouts make the website look great
                    on desktops, tablets, and mobile phones.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">💻</div>
                <h3>Open Source</h3>
                <p>
                    Share your code, customize your design,
                    and collaborate with developers on GitHub.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Projects Section -->
    <section class="projects" id="projects">
        <h2 class="section-title">My Projects</h2>

        <p class="section-description">
            Here are some examples of projects you can showcase
            on your personal website.
        </p>

        <div class="cards">

            <div class="project-card">
                <h3>🌐 Personal Website</h3>
                <p>
                    A responsive website built using HTML and CSS
                    to introduce yourself and your skills.
                </p>
                <a href="#about" class="project-link">
                    Learn More →
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="project-card">
                <h3>🎨 Web Design</h3>
                <p>
                    A modern web design concept featuring
                    attractive colors and reusable components.
                </p>
                <a href="#features" class="project-link">
                    View Features →
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="project-card">
                <h3>📂 GitHub Pages</h3>
                <p>
                    A static website published online using
                    GitHub Pages without a paid hosting service.
                </p>
                <a
                    href="https://pages.github.com/"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="project-link"
                >
                    Get Started →
                </a>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- About Section -->
    <section id="about">
        <div class="about-content">
            <h2 class="section-title">About This Project</h2>

            <p class="section-description">
                MyProject is a simple starter website created
                using HTML and CSS. It is suitable for students,
                beginners, portfolios, college assignments, and
                personal projects. Customize the content and links
                to make it your own.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <p>
            &copy; 2026 MyProject. All rights reserved.
        </p>

        <p>
            Built with ❤️ using HTML and CSS |
            <a
                href="https://github.com/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
                GitHub
            </a>
        </p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
